# C++
**/cmake-build*/
**/build*/
**/*.so
**/*.log*

# Omniverse
**/*.dmp
**/.thumbs

# No USD files allowed in the repo
# **/*.usd
**/*.usda
**/*.usdc
**/*.usdz
/results
.omc/
.db
